OL,3,GNEWSA'It's called a phone' - why young
OL,4,Apeople don't need to be in the big
OL,5,Asmoke to work in fashion
OL,6,
OL,7,FDo you need to go to a big city to work
OL,8,Fin fashion?
OL,10,FFormer director at Givenchy, Julien
OL,11,FMacdonald doesn't think so, nor does
OL,12,FIoan Bowen-Pickett, a young Welsh
OL,13,Ffashion designer.
OL,15,FMacdonald said there was no need for
OL,16,Faspiring designers to leave for cities
OL,17,Fsuch London any more, thanks to a
OL,18,Fdevice you're likely reading this
OL,19,Farticle on.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
