OL,3,GNEWSA'It's called a phone' - why young
OL,4,Apeople don't need to be in the big
OL,5,Asmoke to work in fashion
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Fashion Britain, a concept born by
OL,8,Fthe British Fashion Council (BFC)
OL,9,Foriginally launched its scheme to take
OL,10,Ffashion on a tour of the UK beyond
OL,11,FLondon, it had excluded Wales.
